{
  "_adr": "ADR-0047 (docs/decisions/0047-role-permission-read-closure.md)",
  "_description": "Screen-read closure manifest. Declares, per guarded screen, the supporting reads it fires on load. RolePermissionClosureTest verifies (a) each declared gate matches the live @PreAuthorize, (b) required closure-bearing reads are seeded, (c) no phantom codes, (d) every screen has a non-blank accessPermission seeded. Do NOT edit without running RolePermissionClosureTest.",
  "_gate_forms": "has | scoped | hasOrMember | scopedOrMember | disjunction. A 'disjunction' row carries code (primary) and altCode (the OR-branch).",
  "screens": [
    {
      "screen": "ar.record-receipt",
      "accessPermission": "AR.RECEIPT.RECORD",
      "reads": [
        {
          "controller": "CustomerController",
          "code": "CUSTOMER.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "has"
        },
        {
          "controller": "ArReceiptController",
          "code": "AR.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "has"
        },
        {
          "controller": "BranchController",
          "code": "BRANCH.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "scopedOrMember"
        },
        {
          "controller": "WhtTypeController",
          "code": "WHT.VIEW",
          "necessity": "optional",
          "gate": "hasOrMember"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "screen": "ap.record-payment",
      "accessPermission": "AP.PAYMENT.RUN",
      "reads": [
        {
          "controller": "SupplierController",
          "code": "SUPPLIER.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "has"
        },
        {
          "controller": "ApPaymentController",
          "code": "AP.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "has"
        },
        {
          "controller": "BranchController",
          "code": "BRANCH.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "scopedOrMember"
        },
        {
          "controller": "WhtTypeController",
          "code": "WHT.VIEW",
          "necessity": "optional",
          "gate": "hasOrMember"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "screen": "ap.enter-supplier-bill",
      "accessPermission": "AP.BILL.ENTER",
      "reads": [
        {
          "controller": "SupplierController",
          "code": "SUPPLIER.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "has"
        },
        {
          "controller": "PurchaseOrderController",
          "code": "PURCHASE.ORDER.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "disjunction",
          "altCode": "AP.BILL.ENTER"
        },
        {
          "controller": "ProductController",
          "code": "PRODUCT.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "hasOrMember"
        },
        {
          "controller": "BranchController",
          "code": "BRANCH.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "scopedOrMember"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "screen": "purchases.goods-receipt-create",
      "accessPermission": "PURCHASE.RECEIVE",
      "_notes": [
        "PO picker list (PurchaseOrderController list handler) is gated 'PURCHASE.ORDER.VIEW or AP.BILL.ENTER or PURCHASE.RECEIVE' — declared below as a disjunction (the gate-parser pins the first two codes; PURCHASE.RECEIVE is the third disjunct and is seed-verified via this screen's accessPermission).",
        "The chosen PO's header (GET /uid/{uid}) and lines (GET /uid/{uid}/lines) are scoped reads gated 'PURCHASE.ORDER.VIEW or PURCHASE.RECEIVE'; the closure test only parses the list handler per controller, so these uid-path reads are documented here rather than as separate parseable rows.",
        "Org/company bootstrap reads (GET /organisations/current, GET /companies/accessible) are isAuthenticated()-only, not permission-gated, so they are intentionally not declared (a storekeeper passes them)."
      ],
      "reads": [
        {
          "controller": "PurchaseOrderController",
          "code": "PURCHASE.ORDER.VIEW",
          "necessity": "required",
          "gate": "disjunction",
          "altCode": "AP.BILL.ENTER"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "screen": "manufacturing.work-orders",
