    {
      "screen": "cashbank.record-entry",
      "accessPermission": "CASH.ENTRY.RECORD",
      "_notes": [
        "F26: the counter-GL-account picker (ChartOfAccountController list handler) is gated 'GL.VIEW or CASH.ENTRY.RECORD or CASH.VIEW' — declared below as a disjunction (the gate-parser pins the first two codes; CASH.VIEW is the third disjunct and is seed-verified independently as this screen's own cashbank read companion).",
        "GL accounts are financially sensitive, so the read-floor is broadened only to the adjacent cash verbs (F23 AP.BILL.ENTER/PURCHASE.RECEIVE precedent), NOT to plain company membership.",
        "Tenant isolation is unchanged: ChartOfAccountServiceImpl.list keeps scopeGuard.assertCanActIn(ctx, companyId)."
      ],
      "reads": [
