    {
      "screen": "sales.invoices",
      "accessPermission": "SALES.INVOICE.VIEW",
      "_notes": [
        "F26: the optional route picker on the create form (RouteController list handler) is gated 'ROUTE.VIEW or SALES.INVOICE.VIEW or SALES.ORDER.VIEW' — declared below as a disjunction (the gate-parser pins the first two codes; SALES.ORDER.VIEW is the third disjunct, seed-verified independently).",
        "Routes are low-sensitivity, company-scoped reference data (F21 branch/product/WHT sensitivity tier), but the read-floor is kept to the adjacent sales verbs rather than plain membership so least-privilege is preserved.",
        "Tenant isolation is unchanged: RouteServiceImpl.list keeps scopeGuard.assertCanActIn(ctx, companyId)."
      ],
      "reads": [
        {
          "controller": "RouteController",
          "code": "ROUTE.VIEW",
          "necessity": "optional",
          "gate": "disjunction",
          "altCode": "SALES.INVOICE.VIEW"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
